WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.420
Our message is very simple.

00:01.420 --> 00:04.320
If you come illegally into the United States,

00:04.320 --> 00:06.540
you're going to jail, or you're going back

00:06.540 --> 00:11.160
to where you came from, or perhaps even further than that.

00:11.160 --> 00:13.120
You know what that means.

